{"id":"level-up-2026-10-23","name":"2026-10-23 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1751","en":"Finishing the first draft by Friday is a realistic target.","zh":"周五前完成初稿是个现实可行的目标。","note":"realistic · 现实的， 实际的； 恰如其分的； 逼真的 · a realistic target","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1752","en":"Ignoring a guest's question is discourteous behaviour at any gathering.","zh":"无论什么聚会，忽视客人的问题都是失礼的行为。","note":"discourteous · 无礼的， 粗鲁的 · discourteous behaviour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1753","en":"The new community centre will create opportunities for local artists.","zh":"新的社区中心将为当地艺术家创造机会。","note":"create · 创造， 创作；  产生 · create opportunities","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1754","en":"The region's extreme aridity makes farming particularly difficult.","zh":"该地区极度干旱，使农业耕作尤其困难。","note":"aridity · 干旱； 乏味 · extreme aridity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1755","en":"The newspaper published a fictional story about a criminal investigation.","zh":"这家报纸刊登了一篇关于刑事调查的虚构故事。","note":"criminal · 犯罪的；刑事的；罪犯 · a criminal investigation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1756","en":"The recalcitrant child refused to leave the playground.","zh":"那个倔强不听话的孩子拒绝离开游乐场。","note":"recalcitrant · 顽抗的， 反抗的 · a recalcitrant child","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1757","en":"The children were curious about the unusual shell on display.","zh":"孩子们对展出的奇特贝壳感到好奇。","note":"curious · 好奇的； 奇怪的 · curious about","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1758","en":"The oral history archive is a valuable resource for local researchers.","zh":"口述历史档案是当地研究人员的宝贵资源。","note":"resource · 资源〔指土地、矿产等〕；向…提供资源 · a valuable resource","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1759","en":"My aunt likes to pamper her cat with expensive toys.","zh":"姑姑喜欢给她的猫买昂贵玩具，宠着它。","note":"pamper · 纵容， 娇惯； 精心护理 · pamper a pet","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1760","en":"A powerful earthquake damaged several historic buildings near the coast.","zh":"一次强烈地震损坏了海岸附近的几座历史建筑。","note":"earthquake · 地震 · a powerful earthquake","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1761","en":"In his recurring nightmare, he always misses the last train.","zh":"在他反复做的噩梦里，他总是赶不上末班火车。","note":"nightmare · 噩梦； 可怕的事物 · a recurring nightmare","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1762","en":"Her prolonged absence left the small team struggling to cope.","zh":"她长时间缺席，使这个小团队疲于应付。","note":"prolonged · 持久的， 长期的 · a prolonged absence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1763","en":"Better roof insulation helped the house retain warmth during winter.","zh":"更好的屋顶隔热层帮助房子在冬季保暖。","note":"insulation · 隔绝， 隔绝状态； 绝缘， 隔热， 隔音 · roof insulation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1764","en":"Keep the power cord away from the wet floor.","zh":"不要让电源线接触湿地板。","note":"cord · 线； 带 · a power cord","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1765","en":"The discussion returned to the core issue of affordable transport.","zh":"讨论回到了交通费用是否可负担这一核心问题。","note":"core · 果心，果核；中心部分；核心，要点，精髓；去掉核 · the core issue","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1766","en":"The local council agreed to repair the broken playground fence.","zh":"地方议会同意修复游乐场破损的围栏。","note":"council · 理事会， 委员会 · the local council","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1767","en":"The fictional detective reviews the records during a fraud investigation.","zh":"小说中的侦探在调查诈骗案时审阅记录。","note":"fraud · 诈骗罪； 骗子； 伪劣品， 冒牌货 · a fraud investigation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1768","en":"Draw a rectangle around the title on your poster.","zh":"在海报标题周围画一个长方形。","note":"rectangle · 长方形， 矩形 · draw a rectangle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1769","en":"We met our guide outside the embassy at nine.","zh":"九点时，我们在大使馆外与导游碰面。","note":"embassy · 大使馆； 大使馆全体官员 · outside the embassy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1770","en":"We had to dash across the courtyard before the rain worsened.","zh":"我们不得不赶在雨势加大前冲过庭院。","note":"dash · 飞奔，猛冲；猛掷；使破灭，使沮丧；飞奔， 猛冲； 破折号； 精力， 干劲 · dash across","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1771","en":"The photographs document urban sprawl beyond the city's former boundaries.","zh":"这些照片记录了城市超出原有边界的无序扩张。","note":"sprawl · 伸开四肢坐、 卧或倒下； 杂乱无序地延伸；四肢伸开的姿势或动作；无计划发展 · urban sprawl","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1772","en":"We need concrete evidence before deciding which explanation is correct.","zh":"我们需要具体证据，才能判断哪一种解释正确。","note":"concrete · 混凝土制的；确实的，具体的；有形的，实在的；混凝土 · concrete evidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1773","en":"The main purpose of the visit was to inspect the roof.","zh":"这次到访的主要目的是检查屋顶。","note":"purpose · 打算， 企图， 决心；目的，意图；用途，效果 · the main purpose","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1774","en":"Late cancellation may result in a financial penalty.","zh":"临时取消可能会导致经济处罚。","note":"penalty · 惩罚； 罚金 · a financial penalty","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1775","en":"The poet lived in exile while writing her most famous collection.","zh":"这位诗人在流亡期间创作了她最著名的诗集。","note":"exile · 放逐，流放， · live in exile","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1776","en":"The footbridge provides a direct link between the two campuses.","zh":"这座人行桥直接连接了两个校区。","note":"link · 连接， 联系；环节；联系，纽带 · a direct link","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1777","en":"The factory began producing bicycles on a large scale.","zh":"这家工厂开始大规模生产自行车。","note":"scale · 规模，大小；；攀登， 爬越 · on a large scale","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1778","en":"The cook added starchy vegetables to make the soup thicker.","zh":"厨师加入含淀粉的蔬菜，使汤更浓稠。","note":"starchy · 含淀粉的 · starchy vegetables","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1779","en":"Dense vegetation hid the entrance to the abandoned garden.","zh":"茂密的草木遮住了废弃花园的入口。","note":"vegetation · 植物， 草木 · dense vegetation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1780","en":"A security guard checked our passes at the museum entrance.","zh":"一位保安在博物馆入口检查了我们的通行证。","note":"security · 安全，保障；抵押品； · a security guard","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1781","en":"The plant's limp leaves hung over the edge of the pot.","zh":"这株植物耷拉的叶子垂到了花盆边缘。","note":"limp · 软的； 无力的 · limp leaves","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1782","en":"The students volunteered to organize an event for new arrivals.","zh":"学生们自愿为新来者组织一场活动。","note":"organize · 组织， 使有条理； 成立 · organize an event","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1783","en":"He offered a feeble excuse for forgetting the rehearsal.","zh":"他为忘记排练找了一个站不住脚的借口。","note":"feeble · 虚弱的； 无效的 · a feeble excuse","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1784","en":"The disappointing results prompted us to rethink the experiment.","zh":"令人失望的结果促使我们重新考虑这项实验。","note":"disappointing · 令人失望的 · disappointing results","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1785","en":"A broken limb hung from the old tree after the storm.","zh":"暴风雨后，一根折断的粗枝悬挂在老树上。","note":"limb · 肢， 臂； 树枝 · a broken limb","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1786","en":"The students measured salinity at several points along the estuary.","zh":"学生们在河口沿线的几个地点测量了盐度。","note":"salinity · 盐分， 盐度 · measure salinity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1787","en":"Light refreshments will be available after the afternoon lecture.","zh":"下午的讲座结束后将提供简单茶点。","note":"refreshment · 恢复； · light refreshments","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1788","en":"The course explores how researchers investigate language and human cognition.","zh":"这门课程探索研究人员如何研究语言与人类认知。","note":"cognition · 感知， 认知； 认识力 · human cognition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1789","en":"Regular practice helped build her confidence in public speaking.","zh":"经常练习帮助她增强了公开演讲的信心。","note":"confidence · 信任； 信心 · build confidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1790","en":"The restoration team used lime mortar to repair the old wall.","zh":"修复团队用石灰砂浆修补了旧墙。","note":"lime · 石灰 · lime mortar","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1791","en":"The restaurant introduces visitors to the region's traditional cuisine.","zh":"这家餐厅向游客介绍本地区的传统菜肴。","note":"cuisine · 烹饪； 烹调法， 烹调风格； 菜肴 · regional cuisine","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1792","en":"She was intent on finishing the sketch before sunset.","zh":"她一心想在日落前完成素描。","note":"intent · 专心的， 专注的； 急切的；意图，意向，目的 · intent on","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1793","en":"The recipe calls for an ounce of butter.","zh":"这个食谱需要一盎司黄油。","note":"ounce · 盎司 · an ounce of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1794","en":"Keeping the exhibition dry presented a practical challenge during the storm.","zh":"暴风雨中，保持展览物品干燥成了一项实际难题。","note":"challenge · 挑战；质疑；艰巨任务，难题；挑战； 质疑 · a practical challenge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1795","en":"The small lamp can emit light for several hours.","zh":"这盏小灯可以连续发光数小时。","note":"emit · 发出， 射出， 散发， 排放 · emit light","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1796","en":"The inn offered a cosy room overlooking the snowy garden.","zh":"旅店提供了一间俯瞰雪中花园的舒适客房。","note":"cosy · 舒适的， 安逸的 · a cosy room","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1797","en":"We intend to finish the survey before the summer holidays.","zh":"我们打算在暑假前完成调查。","note":"intend · 想要， 打算 · intend to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1798","en":"The thin branch began to snap under the heavy snow.","zh":"细树枝在沉重积雪下开始折断。","note":"snap · 咔嚓折断，啪地绷断；打开；咬；厉声说话，怒声责斥；突然的， 匆忙的；咔嚓声 · snap in half","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1799","en":"The candle continued to flicker in the evening breeze.","zh":"蜡烛在晚风中不停闪烁。","note":"flicker · 闪烁； 一闪而过 · flicker in the wind","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:s1800","en":"The guide includes numerous examples of common printing mistakes.","zh":"这本指南包含了大量常见印刷错误的例子。","note":"numerous · 众多的 · numerous examples","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:w1751","en":"realistic","zh":"现实的， 实际的； 恰如其分的； 逼真的","note":"英 /ˌrɪə'lɪstɪk;ˌriːə'lɪstɪk/ · 美 /,riə'lɪstɪk/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1751-uk-77722848544d.mp3","text":"realistic"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1751-us-e12edce5750c.mp3","text":"realistic"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:w1752","en":"discourteous","zh":"无礼的， 粗鲁的","note":"英 /dɪs'kɜːtɪəs/ · 美 /dɪs'kɝtɪəs/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1752-uk-86d86ad5ff1f.mp3","text":"discourteous"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1752-us-bf0974a990e0.mp3","text":"discourteous"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:w1753","en":"create","zh":"创造， 创作；  产生","note":"英 /kri'eɪt/ · 美 /krɪ'et/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1753-uk-254dac03e197.mp3","text":"create"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1753-us-d0a034742983.mp3","text":"create"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-23:w1754","en":"a